{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id557061404"}, "name":{"label":"RobertCorey13"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-04T12:28:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"12271060395"}, "title":{"label":"Love this but having issues"}, "content":{"label":"I really like this tool. However, I had to update my Apple payment method and now it won’t work. It shows active subscription but when I try to record it opens the page to set up subscription. No matter what I do I keep getting the subscription screen.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6451491556&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id211317021"}, "name":{"label":"ChadFair"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-28T06:51:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.7.8"}, "id":{"label":"12241255586"}, "title":{"label":"Note Taking Magic"}, "content":{"label":"Wow…this is a magical app! I work with an offshore IT team and sometimes the English accents are tough to understand. Wave knows exactly what they are saying and summarizes every discussion succinctly. The AI summaries also capture key points I may have missed or interpreted incorrectly so it serves as a second level review after each meeting is completed. I jumped on subscribing after the first recording since I can no longer function without it. It was worth every penny! Also, it’s already saved me twice in two days.  I can now focus on the conversation instead of the distraction of scribing notes I often can’t interpret later. I honestly don’t know how I functioned without it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6451491556&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35889134"}, "name":{"label":"nidus_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-23T08:30:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.7.8"}, "id":{"label":"12221442595"}, "title":{"label":"Garbage App Don't Waste Your Money - Stay Away"}, "content":{"label":"This app seemed to be exactly what I was looking for to help supplement my note taking during meetings. \n\nUNFORTUNATELY, THIS APP IS GARBAGE.\n\nI experienced frequent crashing, inconsistent post-call processing (summary and transcript uploads), and poor customer service by the founder, Josh, who made promises that an update would fix the issues, but it did not.\n\nMy request for refund was then denied, even though the app DOES NOT work as intended. If a product doesn't work any payment should be refunded immediately. This is business 101. I am out $100 and this app still doesn't function properly.\n\nSave yourself the trouble and money, and purchase ANY other AI note taking app besides this one.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6451491556&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id34722421"}, "name":{"label":"Osaga"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-23T02:56:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.7.8"}, "id":{"label":"12220301472"}, "title":{"label":"Solid features, simple and fast. Best of the note taking apps!"}, "content":{"label":"Definitely the best AI note taking app of all the ones out there, including Otter. Great feature set well keeping things simple and the workflow fast. I love how I can tell it how I want my notes summarized. Fantastic and responsive support and development team. Don’t waste your time with any of the other apps out there.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6451491556&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id11098056"}, "name":{"label":"ZD82"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-22T21:22:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.7.8"}, "id":{"label":"12219461942"}, "title":{"label":"App does not do what it says"}, "content":{"label":"Tried multiple times to set up the app but it requires verification of your phone number and the developer apparently doesn’t support non-US numbers.  I also requested a refund immediately after signing up (ie within one day) and was refused.  Waste of $140.  Do your research first.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6451491556&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
